    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Judah’s Leaders Judged"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Note this: The Lord God of Armies",
          "is about to remove from Jerusalem and from Judah",
          "every kind of security:",
          "the entire supply of bread and water,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "heroes and warriors,",
          "judges and prophets,",
          "fortune-tellers and elders,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "commanders of fifty and dignitaries,",
          "counselors, cunning magicians, and necromancers."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I will make youths their leaders,",
          "and unstable rulers will govern them.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The people will oppress one another,",
          "man against man, neighbor against neighbor;",
          "the young will act arrogantly toward the old,",
          "and the worthless toward the honorable."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A man will even seize his brother",
          "in his father’s house, saying,",
          "“You have a cloak #— #you be our leader!",
          "This heap of rubble will be under your control.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "On that day he will cry out, saying,",
          "“I’m not a healer.",
          "I don’t even have food or clothing in my house.",
          "Don’t make me the leader of the people! ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For Jerusalem has stumbled",
          "and Judah has fallen",
          "because they have spoken and acted against the Lord,",
          "defying his glorious presence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The look on their faces testifies against them,",
          "and like Sodom, they flaunt their sin;",
          "they do not conceal it.",
          "Woe to them,",
          "for they have brought disaster on themselves."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Tell the righteous that it will go well for them,",
          "for they will eat the fruit of their labor."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Woe to the wicked #— #it will go badly for them,",
          "for what they have done will be done to them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Youths oppress my people,",
          "and women rule over them.",
          "My people, your leaders mislead you;",
          "they confuse the direction of your paths."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord rises to argue the case",
          "and stands to judge the people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord brings this charge",
          "against the elders and leaders of his people:",
          "“You have devastated the vineyard.",
          "The plunder from the poor is in your houses."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Why do you crush my people",
          "and grind the faces of the poor? ”",
          "This is the declaration",
          "of the Lord God of Armies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Jerusalem’s Women Judged"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord also says:",
          "Because the daughters of Zion are haughty,",
          "walking with heads held high",
          "and seductive eyes,",
          "prancing along,",
          "jingling their ankle bracelets,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Lord will put scabs on the heads",
          "of the daughters of Zion,",
          "and the Lord will shave their foreheads bare."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "On that day the Lord will strip their finery: ankle bracelets, headbands, crescents,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "pendants, bracelets, veils,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "headdresses, ankle jewelry, sashes, perfume bottles, amulets,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "signet rings, nose rings,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "festive robes, capes, cloaks, purses,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "garments, linen clothes, turbans, and shawls."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Instead of perfume there will be a stench;",
          "instead of a belt, a rope;",
          "instead of beautifully styled hair, baldness;",
          "instead of fine clothes, sackcloth;",
          "instead of beauty, branding."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your men will fall by the sword,",
          "your warriors in battle."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then her gates will lament and mourn;",
          "deserted, she will sit on the ground."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
